meta {
  name: Get User Stats
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/{{userId}}/stats
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  The numbers on a profile. Expect 200 with checkinCount, placeCount (distinct
  Google place ids) and topPlaces: up to three places ordered by how many
  times the user checked in there, ties going to the most recent visit. Each
  top place carries the name and primary type from its latest checkin.

  Someone with no checkins gets zeros and an empty topPlaces, not a 404.
}
